Recommended Order (Memorize This)

Inside a component, follow this exact sequence:

1. Props destructuring
function Component({ id, name }) {}

2. State hooks
const [data, setData] = useState(null);

3. Refs
const ref = useRef();

4. Derived values (useMemo)
const computed = useMemo(() => ..., []);

5. Callbacks (useCallback)
const handleClick = useCallback(() => {}, []);

6. Effects (useEffect) → LAST among hooks
useEffect(() => {}, []);

7. Event handlers / helpers
function handleSubmit() {}

8. Conditional returns
if (!data) return null;

9. JSX return